xternal_resource/7f79eb60-b8d8-4d8e-9b79-6ace0de1ff17.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "MBB 投委会测算工具", "ownerName": "user_40b4bb09", "score": 1494.3215780035864, "slug": "mbb-model-smith", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780551887972, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779500503645, "description": "访问和分析腾讯文档上的2026届校招汇总表格。当用户询问2026校招、应届生求职、春招表、秋招表、校招信息、校园招聘时使用此技能。此技能负责连接腾讯文档、读取文档内容，并按公司、城市、专业等条件筛选校招数据。", "description_zh": "访问和分析腾讯文档上的2026届校招汇总表格。当用户询问2026校招、应届生求职、春招表、秋招表、校招信息、校园招聘时使用此技能。此技能负责连接腾讯文档、读取文档内容，并可按公司、城市、专业等条件筛选校招数据。", "downloads": 50, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_0b65fce7/campus-jobs", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/cab3c5ed-3acd-4936-a59b-5f0c5f5dab1b.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "职场家-2026校招分析", "ownerName": "user_0b65fce7", "score": 5827.505827505827, "slug": "campus-jobs", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780544987921, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779186196660, "description": "API key for MaxHub data APIs. Get one at https://www.aconfig.cn", "description_zh": "Reddit 数据查询助手。覆盖帖子详情、版块、用户、搜索、评论、推荐等全功能。", "downloads": 50, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_2a9d366c/maxhub-reddit-skillhub", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/a78375f1-773e-4817-b4f3-0557b6afd777.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "true"}, "name": "maxhub-reddit-skillhub", "ownerName": "user_2a9d366c", "score": 1264.2225031605562, "slug": "maxhub-reddit-skillhub", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780540617838, "version": "1.0.1"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779186161383, "description": "API key for MaxHub data APIs. Get one at https://www.aconfig.cn", "description_zh": "临时邮箱服务助手。支持生成临时邮箱、获取邮件列表和邮件详情。", "downloads": 50, "homepage":